.TH SOLARISPKN-PASTE 1 "November 2026" "SolarisPKN" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
solarispkn-paste \- integrity-verified Linux file copy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B solarispkn-paste
.RI "profile " "PATH"
.br
.B solarispkn-paste
.RI "copy " "SOURCE DESTINATION [OPTIONS]"
.br
.B solarispkn-paste
.RI "benchmark " "[OPTIONS]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
A native Python 3 userspace copier that stages writes and compares digests.
The external b3sum utility provides BLAKE3. SHA-256 is available by explicit
selection. Experimental; not a production recovery or backup program.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display command-specific help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR b3sum (1),
.BR sha256sum (1)
.SH AUTHORS
SolarisPKN contributors.
